  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nGiven statement : 12 * 8 * 3 * 2 * 5 * 1 * 5 * 10\n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the * signs :\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : −, +, ×, ×, ÷, ×, = \n\n12 * 8 * 3 * 2 * 5 * 1 * 5 * 10 ⇒ 12 - 8 + 3 × 2 × **5 ÷ 1**__ × 5 = 10 \n\n12 - 8 + __**3 × 2 **____**× **____5____** ×**____** 5**__ = 10\n\n__**12 + 150**__ - 8 = 10\n\n__**162 - 8**__ = 10\n\n154 ≠ 10 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : ×,−, +, ×, ÷, ×, = \n\n12 * 8 * 3 * 2 * 5 * 1 * 5 * 10 ⇒ 12 × 8 - 3 + 2 × **5 ÷ 1**__ × 5 = 10\n\n__**12 × 8**__ - 3 + __**2**____** × **____5____** ×**____** 5**__ = 10\n\n__**96 + 50**__ - 3 = 10\n\n__**146 - 3**__ = 10\n\n143 ≠ 10 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : ×, ÷, ×, ×, =,−, +\n\n12 * 8 * 3 * 2 * 5 * 1 * 5 * 10 ⇒ 12 × **8 ÷ 3**__ × 2 × 5 = 1 - 5 + 10\n\n__**12 ×**____** **__**__2.66__**__** × 2 × 5**__ = __**1 **____**+**____** 10**__ - 5\n\n320 = __**11 - 5**__\n\n320 ≠ 6 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : -, +, ×, ÷, ×, ×, =\n\n12 * 8 * 3 * 2 * 5 * 1 * 5 * 10 ⇒ 12 - 8 + 3 × **2 ÷ 5**__ × 1 × 5 = 10\n\n12 - 8 + __**3 **____**×**____** **__**__0.4__**__** × 1 ×**____** 5**__ = 10\n\n__**12 + 6**__ - 8 = 10\n\n__**18 - 8**__ = 10\n\n**10 = 10 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nHence, \"Option - (4)\" is the correct answer.",
